        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We had a lovely visit at this unique historical building; nice expo that brought us back to the history. Clear arrow signs on the floor to show us the expo direction without running into each other. Cute little boutique at the entrance of the museum supporting local artisans. They also host “Les Seigneuriales,” of which all events are free with people dressed up like old times, combining a “farmers market” type of outdoor booths, quite interesting!",
        "time": 1628473857,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rob Parker",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104213511237836985795/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKSRPWH6Hmh-gj9S99OKl2MMkx8irVIb5GbZrSMDTIT8tC8Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Didn't expect too much, the welcome was great and the exhibitions were clean and well organized. Not the most amount of items to look at, but a nice small museum of the local area. P",
        "time": 1615891954,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J.C. Labelle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113072775974234281531/reviews",
